    "Setup: Player A is in MAIN_PHASE with ST06-014 in base zone (active). Player A has a (Clan) Link Unit in slot1 (ST06-001 + ST06-009 linked). Player A also has another Unit in slot2 to target. Player A has at least 1 shield card.",
    "Action (manual): Player A uses activateCardAbility on ST06-014 effectId=activate_ap_plus_2_if_clan_link_unit_in_play.",
    "Expect: BaseAbilityManager pays restSelf cost by resting the base and emits CARD_RESTED in notificationQueue for (playerId=A, carduid=ST06-014_base_0001, zone=base).",
    "Expect: Because target scope is self_all_unit count=1 and multiple units exist, TARGET_CHOICE is enqueued to processingQueue and a TARGET_CHOICE notification is appended to notificationQueue (frontend-driven).",
    "Action (manual): Player A resolves TARGET_CHOICE selecting slot2 unit.",
    "Expect: Selected unit gets AP+2 until end of turn and CARD_STAT_MODIFIED (stat=modifyAP, delta=2) is appended to notificationQueue."
  ],
